  "content": "<p>若要取得此資料包版本，請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-the-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p><p>在《The Aether》中加入更多《Farmer's Delight》的切板配方<br></p><ul><li>Skyroot 木材的樹皮、去皮和回收</li><li>琥珀收割機可在切板上用黃金橡木去皮以獲得黃金琥珀和樹皮<br><ul><li>(Forge/NeoForge)其他斧頭可以去除黃金橡皮的樹皮但只會有樹皮</li><li>(Fabric)其他斧頭無法在切板上修剪黃金橡木</li></ul></li><li>由花朵提供染料時增加更多染料收獲機會<br></li><li>皮手套回收時有機率變為皮革</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/aether/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Wood Cutting\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/aether/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Flower Cutting\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/aether/media/leatherglovescutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Leather Gloves Cutting\"></p><p>希望一次性獲得所有農民切割功能？請查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Cutting Collection！</a></p>",
